{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24625","headline":"雪夜小饮赠梦得 · 白居易","name":"雪夜小饮赠梦得","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"同爲懒慢园林客，共对萧条雨雪天。\n小酌酒巡销永夜，大开口笑送残年。\n久将时背成遗老，多被人呼作散仙。\n呼作散仙应有以，曾看东海变桑田。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24625.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24625","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}